  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-alpha.10: tlb bakes JSON batches in parallel across all cores, byte-identical to serial (3.6x on 257 files); BakerAssemblyResolver.FromAssemblies scopes in-memory bake resolution; SIMD masks and a shared workspace cut a 20 MB bake from 71 to 60 ms. Playback surface unchanged; source, samples, and tooling byte budgets are enforced.",
